# OfferLoop Assist licensing

OfferLoop Assist contains code under more than one open-source licence.

## Original OfferLoop contributions

Code and documentation originally created by OfferLoop contributors are licensed under the MIT License. The complete licence text is available at `LICENSES/MIT.txt`.

## Inherited and derived portions

Portions of this project are derived from the Free Cluely project and remain subject to the Apache License, Version 2.0. The complete licence text is available at `LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt`.

Upstream provenance and attribution are recorded in `THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt`, `PROVENANCE.md`, `FILE-PROVENANCE.md`, and `COPYRIGHT`.

No MIT notice in this repository removes, limits, or replaces rights and obligations that apply to Apache-2.0-covered or other third-party material. When a file contains both inherited Apache-2.0 material and original MIT-licensed modifications, all applicable licence conditions must be followed.

Copyright ownership of individual contributions remains with their respective copyright holders unless transferred by a separate written agreement.
